B.baX=s(["Kreye kont p\xe8son\xe8l sa a? Verifye im\xe8l la epi transm\xe8t modpas inisyal la atrav\xe8 yon kanal sekirize.","Cr\xe9er ce compte de personnel ? V\xe9rifiez l\u2019email et transmettez le mot de passe initial par un canal s\xe9curis\xe9.","Create this staff account? Verify the email and share the initial password through a secure channel."],t.s)
B.b7J=s(["Yon demann deja k\xf2manse. Done yo bloke pou evite doublon. Antre modpas inisyal la ank\xf2 epi reprann; modpas sa a pa chanje yon kont ki deja kreye.","Une demande a d\xe9j\xe0 commenc\xe9. Les donn\xe9es sont verrouill\xe9es pour \xe9viter un doublon. Ressaisissez le mot de passe initial et reprenez ; cela ne change pas le mot de passe d\u2019un compte d\xe9j\xe0 cr\xe9\xe9.","A request is already in progress. Details are locked to prevent duplicates. Re-enter the initial password and resume; this does not change the password of an already-created account."],t.s)
B.bsK=s(["Sal la ak kont pwopriyet\xe8 a kreye.","La salle et le compte propri\xe9taire sont cr\xe9\xe9s.","The gym and owner account have been created."],t.s)
B.boJ=s(["Eta sal la mete ajou.","L\u2019\xe9tat de la salle est mis \xe0 jour.","Gym status updated."],t.s)
B.bky=s(["Pa gen sal nan lis sa a.","Aucune salle dans cette liste.","No gyms in this list."],t.s)
B.bpG=s(["Sal achive yo","Salles archiv\xe9es","Archived gyms"],t.s)
B.Oz=s(["Aktif","Active","Active"],t.s)
