B.bbc=s(["Yon solisyon konpl\xe8 tout-an-yon pou pilote sal f\xf2s ou, sekirize aks\xe8 yo, epi kontwole tout operasyon yo an tan rey\xe8l.","Une solution tout-en-un pour piloter votre salle de sport, s\xe9curiser les acc\xe8s et superviser toutes vos op\xe9rations en temps r\xe9el.","An all-in-one platform to run your gym, secure access points, and oversee daily operations in real time."],t.s)
